    "History Timeline" : {

    },
    "Home" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الرئيسية"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Home Screen Icon" : {
      "comment" : "A label displayed above the app icon picker.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "I can do that. Review the action below, then tap Apply." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أقدر أسوي ذلك. راجع الإجراء أدناه، ثم اضغط تطبيق."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I can help you understand, plan, and improve %@. Every canvas change still waits for your approval." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "يمكنني مساعدتك على فهم %@ والتخطيط له وتحسينه. سيبقى كل تغيير في اللوحة بانتظار موافقتك."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I couldn't find that exact text in your app, so nothing was changed. Tell me what you'd like to change and I'll take another look." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم أجد هذا النص في تطبيقك، لذلك لم يتغير شيء. أخبرني بما تريد تغييره وسأحاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I couldn't finish preparing our next step. Please try sending your idea again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "لم أتمكن من إعداد خطوتنا التالية. يرجى إرسال فكرتك مرة أخرى."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I couldn't finish your welcome. Please try sending your message again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعذّر عليّ إكمال الترحيب. حاول إرسال رسالتك مجددًا."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I couldn't prepare that change. Please try asking again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعذّر عليّ تجهيز هذا التغيير. حاول الطلب مجددًا."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I found a few places that could match. Pick the one you meant and I'll make the change." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "وجدت أكثر من مكان مطابق. اختر المكان الذي تقصده وسأقوم بالتغيير."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I need you to pick which spot to change before I continue." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "أحتاج منك اختيار المكان المراد تغييره قبل أن أكمل."
          }
        }
      }
    },
